{"version":"0.1","documentType":"opinion","source":{"kind":"lrb_html","caseId":"2017_07158","path":"opinions/coa/2017/2017_07158.htm","publicationStatus":"published"},"header":{"title":"People v Campbell","slipOpinion":"2017 NY Slip Op 07158 [30 NY3d 941]","officialCitation":null,"court":"Court of Appeals","decisionDate":null},"appearances":[],"opinions":[{"kind":"majority","author":null,"label":null,"joiners":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"{**30 NY3d at 942}"},{"type":"text","text":" OPINION OF THE COURT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"{**30 NY3d at 942}"},{"type":"text","text":" OPINION OF THE COURT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Memorandum."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The order of the Appellate Division should be affirmed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Under both federal and state constitutional standards, defendant \"bears the burden of establishing his claim[s] that counsel's performance is constitutionally deficient\" ("},{"type":"link","href":"../2016/2016_01206.htm","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"People v Nicholson"}]},{"type":"text","text":", 26 NY3d 813"}]},{"type":"text","text":", 831 [2016]). Defendant \"must demonstrate the absence of strategic or "},{"type":"text","text":"other legitimate explanations for counsel's alleged failure\" ("},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"id"}]},{"type":"text","text":".). On this record, defendant has not met that burden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Defendant presents ineffective assistance of counsel claims that are \"of the type where 'it . . . [is] essential . . . that an "},{"type":"text","text":"{**30 NY3d at 943}"},{"type":"text","text":"appellate attack on the effectiveness of counsel be bottomed on an evidentiary exploration by collateral or post-conviction proceeding brought under CPL 440.10' \" ("},{"type":"link","href":"../2016/2016_06938.htm","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"People v Henderson"}]},{"type":"text","text":", 28 NY3d 63"}]},{"type":"text","text":", 66 [2016], quoting "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"People v Brown"}]},{"type":"text","text":", 45 NY2d 852, 854 [1978])."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chief Judge DiFiore and Judges Rivera, Stein, Fahey, Garcia, Wilson and Feinman concur."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Order affirmed, in a memorandum."}],"provenance":{"startLine":7,"endLine":21}}]}],"footnotes":[],"disposition":null,"renderingHints":{"hasOfficialPageMarkers":true,"hasAppearances":false,"hasFootnotes":false,"hasSeparateOpinions":false},"debug":{"diagnostics":[]}}
